Z||000017||Voytek||09-20-2001||12:23 PM||||My stripes were painted on before applying the clear coat.  Worked really well.<P>The paint on the mouldings stays on pretty good unless someone whips their door open in a parking lot and dings your car.<P>The truth is that yellow sure stands out and IMO looks really sharp, but any dings in the paint show a lot more than with other colors.||||reg||1
